flowchart LR
    BA[Buyer agent] --> GW[Agent gateway A2A and MCP]
    SA[Supplier agent] --> GW
    GW --> KYA[Agent identity KYA]
    GW --> LLM[LLM layer proposes only]
    GW --> MP[Mandate and policy engine]
    MP --> P2P[PO invoice 3-way match]
    P2P <--> ERP[ERP adapters SAP Coupa Oracle]
    MP --> RR[Rail router]
    RR --> CMP[Compliance screening and Travel Rule]
    CMP --> CARD[Card partner]
    CMP --> ACH[ACH RTP wire bank partner]
    CMP --> CUS[MPC custody quorum]
    CUS --> SC[Stablecoin partner Circle or BVNK]
    CARD --> LED[Ledger and reconciliation]
    ACH --> LED
    SC --> LED
    LED -->|camt.053 and camt.054| ERP
    MP --> AUD[Evidence store]
    CMP --> AUD
    LED --> AUD
